# Git / PR (skraćeno)

**Puni workflow (obavezno):** **`CLAUDE.md`** → sekcija **„Suradnja: Claude vs Cursor“** → **„Cursor agent — Git i PR (obavezno)“**.

Sažetak: nema pusha na **`main`**; rad na **`feat/...`** ili **`fix/...`**; commit + **`git push -u origin <branch>`**; u odgovoru **uvijek** puni link  
`https://github.com/medmcp-dev/core/compare/main...<branch>?expand=1` (ili `/pull/new/<branch>`). Dirty tree → **stash**, sink, nova grana, **stash pop**.
